  "bio": "Welcome to \"Irie Art In Ink,\" the exclusive haven for black & gray and realism tattoo artistry nestled in the charming historic downtown of Buckeye, AZ. Our studio is a haven for ink enthusiasts, where seasoned artists like @tatt2nik, @tattoosby_roach, and our team craft masterpieces on skin with unrivaled precision and passion, making every design a unique piece of personal expression. Join us where art meets individuality in the heart of Arizona's timeless allure.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Buckeye, Arizona, United States"
